Bhai simple logic hai —

Sahi time pe lete hain log 😄

Typical journey hoti hai:

Age 24-26 → Pehli job, skills build karo
Age 26-28 → Job switch, salary jump 40-60%
Age 28-30 → Stable income, city decide, shaadi
Age 30-32 → Tab ghar ka loan lo
Kyun 30 pe better hai:

Salary zyada hoti hai — EMI comfortable hoti hai
Job stable hoti hai — risk kam
City decide ho chuki hoti hai — sahi jagah kharido
Down payment ke liye savings ho chuki hoti hai
Loan amount kam hota hai — interest bhi kam
Example:

30 pe 1 lakh salary → 35k EMI → Comfortable ✅

24 pe 35k salary → 33k EMI → Suffocate ❌

Same ghar, same loan — but timing ka farak itna bada hota hai bhai 😄

Toh parents galat nahi hain ki ghar lena chahiye — timing pe difference hai bas.

Unhe samjhao — "Lunga zaroor, abhi nahi, 30 ke baad." 🙂

