Skills same rahein
Salary difference:

4 switches → 24-30 LPA
3 switches → 22-28 LPA
Difference sirf 2-3 LPA — negligible hai! ✅
Toh bhai best strategy:

Har company mein minimum 1.5 saal raho, skills badhao, tab switch karo 💪

