Package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.SqlServer 10.0.9 is not compatible with net8.0 (.NETCoreApp,Version=v8.0). Package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.SqlServer 10.0.9 supports: net10.0 (.NETCoreApp,Version=v10.0)
