Jun 17
Bhai version mismatch ho gaya! 😅

Problem: Tune .NET 8.0 project banaya hai, but EF Core 10.0.9 sirf .NET 10.0 ke saath compatible hai — version mismatch hai.

Solution — Correct version select karo

Search box mein package version dropdown milega — specific version select karo .NET 8 ke liye:

