markdown
# MercatoPro - E-Commerce Platform

A mini e-commerce application built using ASP.NET Core MVC, demonstrating customer-facing and admin functionalities.

## Tech Stack
- ASP.NET Core MVC (.NET 8)
- Entity Framework Core
- SQL Server
- Razor Views

## Projects
- **MercatoPro** - Customer-facing application (Registration, Login, Product browsing, Cart, Payment)
- **AdminApp** - Admin/Operations panel (Product & Category management)

## Features
- User Authentication (Session-based)
- Product Catalog with Categories
- Shopping Cart
- Order Management
- Admin Panel for Product/Category CRUD

## Database Schema
- Users, Categories, Products, Cart, Orders, OrderItems

## Status
🚧 In Progress - Day 1/14
