Yeh problem hai kyunki:

.gitignore (sahi naam) = Git ignore rules follow karega
gitignore.txt ya gitignore (bina dot) = Git isko ignore file nahi samjhega, yeh normal file ban jayegi
Lekin wait — agar bin/obj/ already ignore ho rahe hain, toh shayad root level pe alag .gitignore hai jo kaam kar raha hai, aur yeh gitignore.txt/gitignore files galti se duplicate ban gayi project folders ke andar.

Abhi ke liye tension mat le — yeh kaam kar raha hai. Bas commit aur push kar de:

bash
