Jun 18
Bhai ekdum sahi sawaal! 😄 Yeh exact mentality hai jo Roopesh dada bhi chahte hain — "dhurandhar" banna hai toh samajh ke likhna hoga, sirf copy-paste nahi.

Chal main tujhe concept by concept sikhata hoon — phir tu khud likhega.

Razor View Samajhne Ka Tarika
1. View kya hota hai?
Yeh ek HTML page hai jisme C# bhi mix kar sakte ho (Razor syntax). .cshtml extension hota hai.

2. @model kya karta hai?
csharp
@model MercatoPro.Models.User
Matlab: "Yeh view ek User object expect karega Controller se."

Kyun zaroori hai: Bina iske, view ko pata nahi chalega FullName, Email jaisi properties kahan se aayengi.

3. Form Tag Helpers Samajh
html
<form asp-action="Register" method="post">
asp-action="Register" → "Jab form submit ho, AccountController ke Register method (POST wala) ko call karo"
method="post" → Data securely bhejega (URL mein nahi dikhega)
4. Input Field Pattern Samajh
html
<input asp-for="FullName" class="form-control" />
asp-for="FullName" → Yeh automatically User model ke FullName property se link ho jata hai
ASP.NET Core khud name="FullName" aur id="FullName" generate kar dega
Yeh manually likhna hota agar tag helper na hota:

html
<input type="text" name="FullName" id="FullName" />
5. Validation Span Samajh
html
<span asp-validation-for="FullName" class="text-danger"></span>
Agar [Required] attribute User.cs mein laga hai aur user khali chhod de — yeh automatically error message dikhayega (red color mein).

