Bhai yeh error aaya kyunki Default Project Package Manager Console mein MercatoPro select hai, but Startup Project (jo actually run hoga) AdminApp set hai — yeh dono match nahi kar rahe.

Fix — Default Project sahi karo

Package Manager Console ke top pe "Default project" dropdown hai — usme AdminApp select karo (na ki MercatoPro), kyunki tu AdminApp ka model change kar raha hai abhi.

Phir try kar:

bash
Add-Migration MakeImageUrlNullable
bash
Update-Database
Important samajh:

AdminApp ka apna Product.cs model hai, MercatoPro ka apna alag Product.cs model hai (dono alag projects hain)
Tune jo ? change kiya — kis project ke Product.cs mein kiya tha?
Dono mein karna hoga (AdminApp aur MercatoPro dono), aur migration bhi dono se separately chalani hogi (kyunki dono ke apne-apne Migrations folder hain, even though database same hai).

Bhai Default Project dropdown se AdminApp select kar, phir commands chala. Phir same MercatoPro select karke bhi chalana hoga agar wahan bhi model change kiya tha. 🙂


