Visual Studio mein wapas jao → Package Manager Console

Default project = AdminApp select karke:

bash
Remove-Migration
Yeh kya karega: Jo migration file fail hui thi (MakeImageUrlNullable jo AdminApp ne banayi thi), usko delete kar dega — kyunki humne manually SQL se already fix kar diya hai, ab AdminApp ko alag se migration banane ki zaroorat nahi.

Bhai Visual Studio mein jaake Package Manager Console mein AdminApp default project select karke Remove-Migration chala. Phir bata ho gaya — phir Product Add test karte hain final! 🙂

