Bhai bahut close hai! 🎯 Ek chhoti but important mistake hai —

csharp
HttpContext.Session.GetInt32("userId");   // ❌ galat key
Login method mein tune session set kiya tha:

csharp
HttpContext.Session.SetInt32("UserId", user.UserId);   // Capital "U"
Session keys case-sensitive hote hain! "userId" aur "UserId" alag-alag mane jayenge — isliye yeh hamesha null return karega, even agar login hai.

Fix:

csharp
int? userId = HttpContext.Session.GetInt32("UserId");   // Capital "U" karo
Yeh fix kar de — baaki sab perfect hai! 🙂

