Bhai yeh dekh — poora tech stack jo tune is project mein use kiya hai:

Tech Stack — MercatoPro Project
Backend:
ASP.NET Core MVC (.NET 8) — Main framework
C# — Programming language
Entity Framework Core 8.0.10 — ORM (database se C# ke through baat karna)
LINQ — Database queries likhne ke liye (ToList(), FirstOrDefault(), Include())
Session Management — Login/Logout ke liye
Database:
SQL Server — Database
EF Core Migrations — Code-First approach se tables banana
Frontend:
Razor Views (.cshtml) — HTML + C# mix
Bootstrap 5 — UI styling, cards, grid system, buttons
HTML5 Forms — Tag Helpers (asp-for, asp-action, asp-controller)
Tools:
Visual Studio — IDE
SSMS (SQL Server Management Studio) — Database management
Git + GitHub — Version control
Concepts Jo Tune Seekhe:
Concept	Kahan Use Kiya
MVC Pattern	Poore project mein
Code-First Migrations	DB tables banana
Dependency Injection	DbContext constructor mein
Session	Login/Logout
Tag Helpers	Forms, validation
Navigation Properties	Include() — Category + Product
ViewBag	Controller se View ko data bhejana
Model Validation	[Required], ModelState.IsValid
CRUD Operations	Category, Product, Cart
Resume Mein Yeh Likhega (baad mein):
ASP.NET Core MVC | C# | Entity Framework Core | 
SQL Server | Bootstrap | Git | Session Management | LINQ
