Bhai mast! 💪 Ab Remove action bhi add karna hai CartController mein — phir test karenge.

CartController mein yeh method add karo:

csharp
[HttpPost]
public IActionResult Remove(int cartId)
{
    var cartItem = _context.Carts.Find(cartId);

    if (cartItem != null)
    {
        _context.Carts.Remove(cartItem);
        _context.SaveChanges();
    }

    return RedirectToAction("Index");
}
Samajh:

Line	Kaam
_context.Carts.Find(cartId)	CartId se woh specific item dhundha
_context.Carts.Remove(cartItem)	Database se delete karne ki taiyari
_context.SaveChanges()	Actually delete kiya
RedirectToAction("Index")	Cart page pe wapas bheja
