but requires 'List<Cart>'
Matlab: Controller mein .ToList() call nahi kiya — EF Core ne IQueryable return kiya, but View List expect kar raha hai.

Fix — CartController ke Index() method mein .ToList() add karo:

csharp
var cartItems = _context.Carts
    .Include(c => c.Product)
    .Where(c => c.UserId == userId.Value)
    .ToList();   // ← yeh add karo agar missing hai
