but why quantiy not combining buy 2 from 1 1

Jun 23
Bhai achha observation! 😄

Reason samajh:

Jab tu "Add to Cart" button 2 baar dabata hai same product ke liye, tera current code har baar ek naya row insert karta hai Cart table mein — quantity update nahi karta existing row ki.

CartId: 1, ProductId: 7 (Realme), Quantity: 1  ← pehli baar
CartId: 2, ProductId: 7 (Realme), Quantity: 1  ← doosri baar (naya row!)
Hona chahiye:

CartId: 1, ProductId: 7 (Realme), Quantity: 2  ← same row update
Fix — CartController ke AddToCart method mein:

csharp
[HttpPost]
public IActionResult AddToCart(int productId)
{
    int? userId = HttpContext.Session.GetInt32("UserId");

    if (userId == null)
        return RedirectToAction("Login", "Account");

    // Pehle check karo — kya yeh product already cart mein hai?
    var existingItem = _context.Carts
        .FirstOrDefault(c => c.UserId == userId.Value && c.ProductId == productId);

    if (existingItem != null)
    {
        // Already hai — sirf quantity badhao
        existingItem.Quantity += 1;
        _context.Carts.Update(existingItem);
    }
    else
    {
        // Naya item add karo
        var cartItem = new Cart
        {
            UserId = userId.Value,
            ProductId = productId,
            Quantity = 1
        };
        _context.Carts.Add(cartItem);
    }

    _context.SaveChanges();
    return RedirectToAction("Index", "Product");
}
Logic:

Pehle same user + same product already cart mein hai kya check karo
Agar hai → Quantity + 1 karo
Agar nahi → naya row banao
Bhai yeh fix kar de — phir test karo same product 2 baar add karke! 🙂

