Bhai DAL (Data Access Layer) ek alag layer hoti hai jahan saara database code (queries, CRUD operations) controller se alag rakha jaata hai — controller sirf DAL ko call karta hai, directly _context use nahi karta.

Abhi ke liye zaroorat nahi hai — yeh pattern larger enterprise projects mein use hota hai, resume ke liye current structure (Controller → EF Core → DB) bilkul sufficient hai, aur Roopesh dada ne bhi iska mention nahi kiya roadmap mein! 😄

