u.Role == "ADMIN" — yeh case-sensitive hai! Database mein tune "Admin" store kiya tha (capital A, baaki lowercase) — toh "ADMIN" match nahi karega.

Fix:

csharp
u.Role == "Admin"   // ✅ sahi
